#1. How to check any taints on the node/worker

controlplane ~ ✖ kubectl describe node node01 | grep -i taints
Taints:             <none>

Create a taint on node01 with key of spray, value of mortein and effect of NoSchedule

#2 Create taint on node node01 with key as below

controlplane ~ ✖ kubectl taint nodes node01 spray=mortein:NoSchedule
node/node01 tainted

controlplane ~ ➜  




